Part 2 — The Analysis Agent Core
Create `server/journal-analysis-agent.js`
This is a standalone Node.js script. It runs nightly. It does NOT share the web request lifecycle with `index.js`.
High-level flow:

```
1. Get all users active in the last 7 days
2. For each user:
   a. Fetch their journal entries (last 7 days)
   b. Fetch their Cabinet conversations (last 7 days)
   c. Fetch their prior analysis records (last 8 weeks) for longitudinal context
   d. Run the analysis via Claude Sonnet
   e. Retrieve grounding passages from RAG corpus
   f. Check for distress signals
   g. Store analysis in journal_analysis table
   h. Queue distress cases for human review
3. Log a run summary

```

